sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SCH as Scheduler
  participant BQ as Count job and BigQuery
  participant FIN as Finance
  participant OWN as Owner
  participant DBT as dbt and checks
  participant CTO as CTO and teams
  Note over SCH,CTO: Working day 1
  SCH->>BQ: Run the monthly loan count
  BQ-->>OWN: Last month's loans and workload are in
  Note over FIN: Working days 1 to 3
  FIN->>BQ: Enter vendor invoices and contract changes
  Note over DBT: Every night
  DBT->>BQ: Rebuild the numbers from billing, inputs and counts
  DBT-->>OWN: Check results, for example a missing invoice or totals that do not match the GCP invoice
  OWN->>FIN: Chase missing or odd items
  Note over OWN: Working day 5
  OWN->>DBT: Close the month and freeze it
  DBT-->>CTO: Dashboards show the closed month
  CTO->>OWN: Monthly review of cost per loan, re-processing cost, budget against actual
  OWN->>FIN: Agreed changes to allocation keys or budget scenarios
